      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c174eb687c3a95c91006283|full_name}: I see. Honestly, I'd rather players report malicious users than limit the ability of people to identify themselves in the way they'd like. I don't want to block someone from saying \"I'm trans\", for example.\nI'm sure there's some words we're missing that we'd want to block, but there's no such thing as a perfect filter. **Even if there was,** I don't think I'd want to use it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
